        "TileImage": "$($repository 729aa28f-5856-449a-9e41-3e4fedc5c38f).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening agent,\rthis contract is of utmost importance to the agency.\r\rIt seems we have booked the town square clock house on the wrong date, therefore we need you to clean house in order to host my birthday party today in just a few hours.\r\rI will leave you to prepare...\r\rIn the meantime i will be busy planning my birthday party I will put the phone on do not disturb so you can&apos;t reach me for further questions, good luck.",
